message: "If you cite this research architecture, please cite it as below."
title: "Reflective Rust: Semantic Reflection, Compiler Graphs, and Reflective Systems Architecture"
abstract: >-
  A staged reflective systems architecture (RRSA) for Rust based on an opaque,
  phase-bounded compiler semantic graph (CSG), compile-time metaprogramming,
  runtime projection, and spatial interfaces.
type: software
